    "description": "Step into this charming semi-detached Edwardian nestled in the heart of vibrant Noe Valley. Sunlight floods the open-concept living and dining area, highlighted by shiplap accents and a cozy fireplace. The kitchen is designed for effortless entertaining and includes a delightful butler's pantry with a wine fridge and coffee bar. The flexible front bedroom with en-suite bath easily doubles as a guest room or office thanks to a convenient Murphy bed. The spacious primary suite at the rear offers two walk-in closets, a light-filled bath with double vanity, and opens onto a private patio with a relaxing hot tub. Downstairs, enjoy a two-car tandem garage, a bonus room ideal for a gym or studio, and abundant storage with expansion potential. Surrounded by Noe Valley's beloved cafs, shops and ultra convenient location, just mins to freeway access, Rail & transit options - don't miss this rare gem in this highly desirable neighborhood!"
  },
